Reason: port: the hx wipes are drawn and advanced one call a frame, counted in frames, so at frame_rate 60 or 120 they ran two or four times as fast and a warp's closing wipe ended before its pipe sound (cut short by the next stage); they advance once per native 30 Hz frame and are drawn on the others from state saved and put back
